Cisco Packet Tracer — Lab 1: Basic LAN

🎯 Objective

Build a basic Local Area Network (LAN) and test communication between computers using Cisco Packet Tracer.

🛠️ Tools Used

- Cisco Packet Tracer
- Cisco 2960 Switch
- Four PCs

⚙️ Practical Tasks

- Connected four PCs to a switch.
- Configured static IPv4 addresses.
- Tested connectivity using the "ping" command.
- Explored PDU information in Simulation Mode.

🌐 IP Addressing

Device| IPv4 Address| Subnet Mask
PC0| 192.168.1.1| 255.255.255.0
PC1| 192.168.1.2| 255.255.255.0
PC2| 192.168.1.3| 255.255.255.0
PC3| 192.168.1.4| 255.255.255.0

